Something in the Water is a 2024 British survival thriller film
directed by Hayley Easton Street and written by Cat Clarke.

12
01:08:48,000 --> 01:08:54,000
Its plot follows a group of friends who meet up for a wedding in the
Caribbean, and become stranded in the sea after their hire boat sinks.

13
